        "id": "D5_PENSION_PAYMENTS",
        "label": "Pension payments"
      },
      {
        "definition": "Benefits, regular support from someone else, or both. Both within this listed category remain one answer category. A different listed source such as salary plus benefits uses the mixed option.",
